LinkUp (com.sajjad.linkup)

Sounds
------
The ringtone (locallink_ringtone.wav, "Triton"), the message tone
(locallink_message.wav, "Salacia"), the in-chat arrived sound
(message_received.wav, "NFC Start") and the sent sound (message_sent.wav,
"Volume blip") in android/app/src/main/res/raw/ are from the Android Open
Source Project (platform/frameworks/base/data/sounds), converted to WAV.

